content+='''<section class="section section-tight"><div class="container enquiry-layout"><aside class="enquiry-aside"><p class="eyebrow">A USEFUL STARTING POINT</p><h2>A few details.<br>A clearer scope.</h2><ol class="simple-steps"><li><span>01</span>Choose a service or describe the need.</li><li><span>02</span>Add the asset, location and objective.</li><li><span>03</span>Review and download your brief.</li></ol><div class="enquiry-expect"><h3>For the scoping discussion</h3><p>We would review feasibility, coverage, access and permissions, specialist needs, output format and mobilisation.</p></div><p class="micro-copy">Beta preparation tool: a brief is created locally on your device. Online submission and availability confirmation are not enabled.</p></aside><div><form id="enquiry-form" class="enquiry-form"><div class="form-title"><h2>Project details</h2><span>Required fields marked *</span></div><div class="form-row"><div><label for="service">Service *</label><select id="service" name="service" required><option value="">Choose a service</option><option value="inspection">Vessel and asset inspection</option><option value="operations">Operations and MWS support</option><option value="imagery">Commercial and project imagery</option><option value="other">Help me define the scope</option></select></div><div><label for="location">Location or region *</label><input id="location" name="location" placeholder="Port, country or offshore site" required maxlength="180" autocomplete="off"></div></div><label for="asset">Asset or operation *</label><input id="asset" name="asset" placeholder="Vessel, jetty, load-out or other asset" required maxlength="240"><label for="objective">What do you need to understand or document? *</label><textarea id="objective" name="objective" rows="4" placeholder="Describe the question, areas of interest or key operation stages." required maxlength="2500"></textarea><div class="form-row"><div><label for="timing">Indicative timing</label><input id="timing" name="timing" placeholder="Target window or to be agreed" maxlength="180"></div><div><label for="output">Preferred output</label><select id="output" name="output"><option>Visual evidence package</option><option>Operation record and timeline</option><option>Commercial photography and video</option><option>To be agreed</option></select></div></div><label for="reviewer">Intended reviewer or audience</label><input id="reviewer" name="reviewer" placeholder="e.g. technical manager, surveyor or marketing team" maxlength="240"><button class="button" type="submit" disabled>Review your brief <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button><p class="micro-copy">Nothing is sent or saved by this website. <a href="privacy.html">Information and privacy</a></p><noscript><p>JavaScript is needed to build your brief. You can also <a href="downloads/AIR_MARINE_Project_Brief.txt" download>download the blank template</a>.</p></noscript></form><section class="brief-review" id="brief-review" aria-labelledby="review-title" hidden><p class="eyebrow">READY FOR DISCUSSION</p><h2 id="review-title" tabindex="-1">Your project brief</h2><pre id="brief-content"></pre><div class="review-actions"><button class="button" id="download-brief" type="button">Download brief <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></button><button class="button outline" id="copy-brief" type="button">Copy text</button><button class="text-button" id="edit-brief" type="button">Edit details</button></div><p id="brief-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></section></div></div></section>'''
page('contact.html','Project enquiry','Prepare a maritime drone project brief with asset, location, objective and preferred deliverables.',content)

content=intro('WEBSITE INFORMATION','Information<br>and privacy.','How this beta website handles the information you enter and the illustrative material it presents.','Information and privacy')+'''<section class="section section-tight"><div class="container reading-width"><h2>Local project brief</h2><p>The enquiry tool processes the fields in your browser to create a text brief. The website does not send the form to AIR MARINE or store it in a database. You choose whether to download or copy the result. Avoid including confidential or sensitive project information in a public demonstration.</p><h2>Website resources</h2><p>The site uses local styles, scripts, images and video assets. It does not include analytics scripts, advertising trackers or third-party form services. GitHub Pages provides hosting and may process technical request information as part of delivering the website.</p><h2>Illustrative material</h2><p>The AI-generated imagery, demonstration footage and sample deliverable structures illustrate the proposed services. They are not evidence of completed client assignments, approved inspection results or an existing certification.</p><h2>Service development</h2><p>This is a beta presentation of AIR MARINE, a KEELCORE initiative. Each assignment requires scope agreement, feasibility review, suitable personnel and equipment, permissions and any relevant specialist or class acceptance arrangements.</p><p class="micro-copy">Updated October 2026</p></div></section>'''
page('privacy.html','Information and privacy','How the AIR MARINE beta website handles local briefs and illustrative material.',content)

